cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "DINOv2-Based Industrial Anomaly Detection with Vision-Language-Model-Generated Quality Control Reports"
abstract: >-
  Code for an MSc thesis. It compares the Dinomaly anomaly detector with
  PatchCore and EfficientAD-S on MVTec AD and VisA, and measures how
  detector evidence and retrieved defect knowledge change the inspection
  reports written by Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct.
authors:
  - family-names: Hun
    given-names: Mehmet Övgü
    affiliation: University of Debrecen, Faculty of Informatics
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/ovguhun/dinov2-vlm-quality-inspection
keywords:
  - industrial anomaly detection
  - vision-language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - MVTec AD
  - VisA
